Tests ability to identify subtle DNS-driven routing issues affecting low-latency telemetries across regions.

## Key Concepts
- DNS-based load balancing, ECS, TTL impacts
- Cross-region latency vs intra-region
- Edge caching and per-region controls

## Code Example
